{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34302","headline":"奉酬袭美早春病中书事 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉酬袭美早春病中书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祗贪诗调苦，不计病容生。\n我亦休文瘦，君能叔宝清。\n药须勤一服，春莫累多情。\n欲入毘耶问，无人敌浄名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}